{"parse": {"title": "Terminology", "pageid": 192, "revid": 44002, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page will list the terms/slang and abbreviations used on certain pages, or just used by community a lot in general.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Terms_.26_Abbreviations\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Terms_&amp;_Abbreviations\">Terms &amp; Abbreviations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AA_-_Anime_Adventures\"><big><b>AA</b> - Anime Adventures</big></span></h3>\n<p>An abbreviation for the name of the game.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"DPS_-_Damage_Per_Second\"><big><b>DPS</b> - Damage Per Second</big></span></h3>\n<p>A calculation of how much damage a unit could theoretically do in 1 second, calculated using {Damage/SPA = DPS}.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"SPA_-_Second_Per_Attack\"><big><b>SPA</b> - Second Per Attack</big></span></h3>\n<p>Alternatively, \"Attack speed\", or how long it will take for a unit to attack.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"CD_-_Cooldown\"><big><b>CD</b> - Cooldown</big></span></h3>\n<p>Short for the amount of time it takes an ability to refresh.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AoE_-_Area_of_Effect\"><big><b>AoE</b> - Area of Effect</big></span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>AoE (Cone)</b> - Attacks with an AoE that resembles a cone. Any enemies within the cone will get damaged.</li>\n<li><b>AoE (Circle)</b> - Attacks with an AoE that resembles a circle . Any enemies within the circle will get damaged.</li>\n<li><b>AoE (Line)</b> - Attacks with an AoE that resembles a line. Any enemies within the line will get damaged.</li>\n<li><b>AoE (Full)</b> - Attacks within said unit's <b>range bubble</b>. Any enemies within the bubble will get damaged.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"META_-_Most_Effective_Tactic_Available\"><big><b>META</b>  - Most Effective Tactic Available</big></span></h3>\n<p>The strongest units/lineup/placements a <b>Player</b> can use or have. To check a unit's viability, visit the <a href=\"/wiki/Tier_Lists\" title=\"Tier Lists\">Tier Lists</a> page.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"RND_-_Random\"><big><b>RND</b> - Random</big></span></h3>\n<p>Short for <b>Random</b>. Commonly used as a term for a Unit's stats. <small><i>Why Random? Refer to the <b><span class=\"new\" title=\"FAQ (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRkFRP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">FAQ</span></b> page.</i></small>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inf_-_Infinite\"><big><b>Inf</b> - Infinite</big></span></h3>\n<p>Short for the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Infinite\" title=\"Infinite\">Infinite</a></b> Gamemode.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"LB_-_Leaderboard\"><big><b>LB</b> - Leaderboard</big></span></h3>\n<p>Short for the <b>Leaderboards</b> in the Lobby.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"TS_-_Timestop\"><big><b>TS</b> - Timestop</big></span></h3>\n<p>Short for <b><a href=\"/wiki/Effects\" title=\"Effects\">Timestop</a></b>, an ability usable by certain Units.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"TA_-_Time_Acceleration\"><b><big>TA - Time Acceleration</big></b></span></h3>\n<p>Short for <b>Time Accel/Acceleration</b>. <a href=\"/wiki/Priest_(Heaven)\" title=\"Priest (Heaven)\">Priest (Heaven)</a>'s Ability.\n</p><p><big><b>RR - Reroll</b></big>\n</p><p>Short for <b>Reroll Tokens</b>, which is the tokens used for rerolling units's <a href=\"/wiki/Traits\" title=\"Traits\">traits</a> <i>(not to be confused with <b>Star Remnants</b>)</i> . It's also a tradable item, and can be used as the base trading value for units/items/...\n</p><p><big><b>LF/MLF/NLF - Looking for/Mainly Looking For/Not Looking For</b></big>\n</p><p>Mainly used in trading to discuss what a trader wants. <small><i>*Could also be used as \"Might Look For\"</i></small>\n</p><p><big><b>SAO - Sword Art Online</b></big>\n</p><p>Used to refer to the map \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://animeadventures.fandom.com/wiki/Story#Virtual_Dungeon\">Virtual Dungeon</a>\".\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023134421\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 40/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_animeadventures853:pcache:idhash:192-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261023134421 and revision id 44002. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "images": [], "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "2", "line": "Terms &amp; Abbreviations", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 132, "anchor": "Terms_&_Abbreviations", "linkAnchor": "Terms_&_Abbreviations"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>AA</b> - Anime Adventures", "number": "1.1", "index": "2", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 161, "anchor": "AA_-_Anime_Adventures", "linkAnchor": "AA_-_Anime_Adventures"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>DPS</b> - Damage Per Second", "number": "1.2", "index": "3", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 251, "anchor": "DPS_-_Damage_Per_Second", "linkAnchor": "DPS_-_Damage_Per_Second"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>SPA</b> - Second Per Attack", "number": "1.3", "index": "4", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 414, "anchor": "SPA_-_Second_Per_Attack", "linkAnchor": "SPA_-_Second_Per_Attack"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>CD</b> - Cooldown", "number": "1.4", "index": "5", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 542, "anchor": "CD_-_Cooldown", "linkAnchor": "CD_-_Cooldown"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>AoE</b> - Area of Effect", "number": "1.5", "index": "6", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 643, "anchor": "AoE_-_Area_of_Effect", "linkAnchor": "AoE_-_Area_of_Effect"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>META</b>  - Most Effective Tactic Available", "number": "1.6", "index": "7", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 1143, "anchor": "META_-_Most_Effective_Tactic_Available", "linkAnchor": "META_-_Most_Effective_Tactic_Available"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>RND</b> - Random", "number": "1.7", "index": "8", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 1339, "anchor": "RND_-_Random", "linkAnchor": "RND_-_Random"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>Inf</b> - Infinite", "number": "1.8", "index": "9", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 1510, "anchor": "Inf_-_Infinite", "linkAnchor": "Inf_-_Infinite"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>LB</b> - Leaderboard", "number": "1.9", "index": "10", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 1594, "anchor": "LB_-_Leaderboard", "linkAnchor": "LB_-_Leaderboard"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>TS</b> - Timestop", "number": "1.10", "index": "11", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 1684, "anchor": "TS_-_Timestop", "linkAnchor": "TS_-_Timestop"}, {"toclevel": 2, "level": "3", "line": "<b>TA - Time Acceleration</b>", "number": "1.11", "index": "12", "fromtitle": "Terminology", "byteoffset": 1798, "anchor": "TA_-_Time_Acceleration", "linkAnchor": "TA_-_Time_Acceleration"}], "showtoc": false, "displaytitle": "<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Terminology</span>"}, "_provenance": {"url": "https://animeadventures.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&oldid=44002&prop=text%7Cimages%7Csections%7Cdisplaytitle&format=json&formatversion=2&disableeditsection=1", "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T13:55:43.403622+00:00", "sha256": "36f7f7a0970ed10ad57b7351b